to make of Openvpn *the best VPN software ever build aimed to be largely
selled*. Now to resolve the funding issue, the project should license
Openvpn like MySQL/Reiser, with dual licensing.

But the main problem will be that OpenVPN will probably have to provide
commercial support or anything like that. Is openvpn ready for that?

